 {id:'F01',title:'Check the warning and local plan',text:'Review the original warning and your organisation’s locally approved flood plan. Confirm the affected area and validity period before assigning work.',tags:'flood warning forecast review information coordinator school clinic community',source:'https://sachet.ndma.gov.in/',basis:'Prototype coordination step informed by the official alert portal; not a quoted official instruction.'},
 {id:'F02',title:'Check communications readiness',text:'Confirm the responsible coordinator, staff contact list and available communication channels. Check that communication devices can be charged safely.',tags:'flood communications phone battery contact school clinic community',source:'https://sachet.ndma.gov.in/DosDont',basis:'Adapted preparedness checklist; review against the current local plan.'},
 {id:'F03',title:'Review essential records and supplies',text:'Review whether essential records are protected from water and whether the site’s approved emergency supplies are ready. Record gaps for the coordinator.',tags:'flood documents records waterproof emergency supplies school clinic community',source:'https://sdma.maharashtra.gov.in/en/dos-and-donts/',basis:'Adapted from general flood preparedness guidance; site-specific requirements are not supplied by this app.'},
 {id:'F04',title:'Confirm support arrangements',text:'Ask the coordinator to review assistance arrangements for people who may need additional support, using the site’s existing plan and authorised contact channels.',tags:'flood accessibility children disability assistance support school clinic community',source:'https://www.niti.gov.in/sites/default/files/2021-03/Annexure-NDMA-Guidelines-compressed.pdf',basis:'Prototype planning prompt informed by NDMA urban-flood capacity-building guidance; no personal records are needed.'},
 {id:'F05',title:'Review authorised movement instructions',text:'Check the official instructions and designated coordinator’s decision about site access or movement. This application does not identify safe routes or decide evacuation.',tags:'flood movement access route evacuation instruction school clinic community',source:'https://sdma.maharashtra.gov.in/en/dos-and-donts/',basis:'Human-review prompt. No route is generated or verified.'},
 {id:'F06',title:'Recheck changes to the warning',text:'Recheck the original warning for updates or cancellation, and reopen the review if the source changes. Record when the review was completed.',tags:'flood update cancel expired warning coordinator school clinic community',source:'https://docs.oasis-open.org/emergency/cap/v1.2/CAP-v1.2.html',basis:'Application lifecycle control based on CAP message references; not emergency advice.'}
